If you mean the "LogFlash" program, I don't see where it's method is a waste 
of time. For me, the repetition is quite helpful; those words I have worked 
through I still have good recognition of. The original methodology used stack 
of cards to accomplish this, back in the day. 

If you mean some other program, then I tend to agree. I haven't found anything 
that works as well as LogFlash for me.

